              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Laurel Buchanan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "didnt really feel like firing up the grill so i put the shrimp in the skillet and then poured in the honey mixture when the shrimp was cooked all the way through, cooked on high until the honey had almost completely boiled off. it was very sweet and very good. maybe next time add dried coconut?",
